# Local build instructions
Instructions for building the website locally on a new machine, which I seem to have to do about once a year.
## Installations


Install rbenv for ruby (https://github.com/rbenv/rbenv-installer#rbenv-installer)

Pre-requisites for ruby listed on https://github.com/rbenv/ruby-build/wiki

Note: as of 2026-04-23, there was no way to resolve dependency conflicts with Ruby 4.0.3, so 3.4.9 or lower was required.


```
# list latest stable versions:
rbenv install -l 

#install a Ruby version:
rbenv install 3.4.9
rbenv local 3.4.9   # set the Ruby version for this directory
gem install bundler
bundle install
```

Install rbenv so that you can install Ruby so that you can install bundler so that you can install the Gems for the project.

## Build

```
bundle exec jekyll serve
```